SKYMASTER - Advanced AI Drone with Orange Pi 5 Pro (Windows Edition)
A complete Windows guide for building an autonomous drone with Follow-Me, Obstacle Avoidance, Gesture Control, and Voice Commands

📌 Overview
This Windows-compatible guide details how to configure an Orange Pi 5 Pro as the AI brain for an advanced drone, integrating with Mission Planner on Windows. Features include:
✅ Follow-Me Mode
✅ Obstacle Avoidance
✅ Gesture Control
✅ Voice Commands (Optional)

