🔧 Windows-Specific Debugging
1. Mission Planner Connection Issues
Check COM port in Device Manager

Ensure baud rate matches (57600)

Update USB drivers if Pixhawk not detected

2. Orange Pi SSH Access
Find Orange Pi IP using Advanced IP Scanner

Connect via PuTTY:

Host: orangepi@[IP]

Password: orangepi

3. MAVProxy Not Forwarding?
Verify Windows firewall allows UDP port 14550

Test connectivity:

cmd
ping [Orange Pi IP]
